   "text": "And that steady, reliable giving is also what helps Watsi and our medical partners plan. Here's what I mean. One of our partner hospitals in Uganda, it simply started as a shed under a jackfruit tree, giving away malaria medicine. And then over more than a decade, built on this kind of consistent support from our Universal Fund, it has now become a new maternal health center.",
